# Hedge Whisperer: "Activate only as a sorcery" (CR 602.5d). Turn 1: Mox Emerald and Mox Ruby pay the Whisperer and Faithless Looting,
# which discards Hero of Bladehold and Llanowar Elves, so four mana value is in the graveyard. On Bot2's turn 4, with {3}{G} in the
# pool from Black Lotus and Mox Emerald and the Whisperer untapped, the activation targeting Dryad Arbor (a land creature, Forest Dryad)
# is refused - on turn 5, in Bot1's own main phase with an empty stack, it is allowed with the same cost paid. "It's still a land" keeps
# the Arbor's Forest and its Dryad: it is a 5/5 green Boar Dryad Forest Plant, not only a Plant Boar (CR 205.1b, as Inkmoth Nexus).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Black Lotus
Hedge Whisperer
Faithless Looting
Dryad Arbor
Island
Hero of Bladehold
Llanowar Elves
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Hedge Whisperer.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Hero of Bladehold; Llanowar Elves)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Dryad Arbor.Play
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
! Bot1.Battlefield.Hedge Whisperer.Activate(Bot1.Battlefield.Dryad Arbor)
Bot1.Pass
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Dryad Arbor.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Hedge Whisperer.Activate(Bot1.Battlefield.Dryad Arbor)
Bot1.Choose(Hero of Bladehold)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Dryad Arbor.Power = 5
Bot1.Battlefield.Dryad Arbor.Types = Land; Creature
Bot1.Battlefield.Dryad Arbor.Subtypes = Boar; Dryad; Forest; Plant
Bot1.Battlefield.Hedge Whisperer.Tapped = true
Exile = Hero of Bladehold
